          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following CSS rules:<br/>@media all and (min-width: 500px){<br/>  div{<br/>    width: 25%;<br/>  }<br/>}<br/>div{<br/>  width: 80%;<br/>}<br/>What is the width of any div elements on a 750px screen?</p><pre><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> all <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">and</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">500px</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">25%</span>;\n  }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">80%</span>;\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét các quy tắc CSS sau:<br/>@media all and (min-width: 500px){<br/>  div{<br/>    width: 25%;<br/>  }<br/>}<br/>div{<br/>  width: 80%;<br/>}<br/>Chiều rộng của các phần tử div trên màn hình 750px là bao nhiêu?</p><pre><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> all <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">and</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">500px</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">25%</span>;\n  }\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">80%</span>;\n}</code></pre></div>",
